      "side": 1,
      "message": "@akailash@google.com will calling `fastboot set_active b` after flashing bootloader still trigger snapshot-merge to occur on boot? That is my assumption.\n\nThe idea here is to replace the existing `hal-\u003eSetActiveBootSlot(target_slot_number)` with equivalent fastboot command during the static partition flashing",
      "parentUuid": "2e944bca_6d369595",
      "revId": "1b435d929bf416a90fe06106ff1603b1b0cb4a29",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
