      "writtenOn": "2025-12-30T23:39:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e will calling fastboot set_active b after flashing bootloader still trigger snapshot-merge to occur on boot? That is my assumption.\n\nAhh ok.. So, you want to just get to the bootloader from the current slot and then forcefully switch the slot.. I think that could work; and yes, that will should trigger merge.",
      "parentUuid": "8c05c4db_41e8e09a",
      "revId": "1b435d929bf416a90fe06106ff1603b1b0cb4a29",
