        "id": 4554676
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-12-30T23:51:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That would be the ideal mode and would allow us to completely avoid booting into bootloader to flash bootloader + static partitions. For now, would this diff be sufficient? As long I manually trigger slot change from bootloader with `fastboot set_active ...` then I don\u0027t have to worry about the current state of the bootloader and it should always work\n\n\n-- Can you also help me understand how the `fastboot snapshot-update cancel` when wiping doesn\u0027t prevent the update? in https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:tools/tradefederation/core/src/com/android/tradefed/util/image/IncrementalImageUtil.java;l\u003d586-600;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d1",
      "parentUuid": "8c05c4db_41e8e09a",
      "revId": "1b435d929bf416a90fe06106ff1603b1b0cb4a29",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a3fd176d_fcf6dd23",
