      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-12-30T23:53:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Ahh ok.. So, you want to just get to the bootloader from the current slot and then forcefully switch the slot.. I think that could work; and yes, that will should trigger merge.\n\nYes, exactly! This gives all the benefits of apply-update without the risk of switching to the unknown bootloader - which is a big problem for me.",
      "parentUuid": "aad9997a_febbab02",
      "revId": "1b435d929bf416a90fe06106ff1603b1b0cb4a29",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
